index 0, stats_index \\\"0\\\", configuration_has_self true, log_last_index 1 and state Follower, at exit 0. Counterevidence is kept explicit: the returned Configuration value itself is correct and current, so callers ignoring the index are unaffected; the index exists inside the main goroutine and is omitted rather than unavailable; nothing documents that it may be unset while it is published as a metric; and no other public accessor offers the pair. The limitations record that the prefix holds a single configuration entry so the comparison cannot distinguish an always-wrong index from a first-configuration-only difference, that the check observes a value rather than a state transition with no downstream consequence measured, that no consumer dependency was established, that the configuration is only checked for containing the local voter, and that the repair location remains open. With the only blocker answered, the assessment for this artifact should recompute to a confirmed violated comparison at implementation_obligation level, completing the obligation and turning its conclusion into a confirmed in-scope result, which would leave the run with five confirmed findings (three consensus-safety, one bounded-liveness, one implementation-semantics) and the remaining frontier limited to the productions-TCP scheduling question, the enqueue-before-shutdown question, the configuration-change/matching question and one deferred surface about the commit context a follower leaves after installing a snapshot. Optional preflight with the trusted validator returned valid=true; the review introduces no new execution and no map change, and the two Chinese fields are presentation only.\"}"}}
